            "notes": "[Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) is the core of this build, it got buffed by 25%. 50% of the HP that you get from items gets added to your bubbles.\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) is 5% more damage (attack speed translates  1:1 to damage on beams, but uses more ammo), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) are what I usually get to help with sustain, and the other items are just kinda bad.",
