            "notes": "[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is our core damage. [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is maybe the best item in the game for its price \u2014 movement speed is very valuable on Zarya too. Keep the green items for attack speed or damage. If you can't afford [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), just get 1\u20132 green HP items since they make your bubble better.\n\nVS armor or shields (blue HP \u2014 NOT barriers), instead of [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), you can get [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66), since this gives 20% attack damage for you \u2014 but no 5% movement speed and it uses more ammo.",
