            "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:54:00.743222+00:00",
            "notes": "[Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848) got much better, and the speed boost is strong. This lets you push aggressively or take damage and then shield yourself to escape.\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is the best item for Zarya \u2014 practically made for her. It's basically 20% damage and 25 armor, which now makes bubble better.\n\nVS armor, you can take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). That's a 15% damage increase vs. armor, since armor reduces beam damage by a flat 30%. You would get this against heroes like Orisa, Rein, or D.Va.\n\n## IMPORTANT\n\n[Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d) is an insane item. I highly recommend buying it if you have enough for it. It's solid VS mobile comps or heroes like Rein that can\u2019t reach you easily if you jump. It gives you access to all high grounds and a better escape, so if you ever have spare money, you can replace one of the green items with this. At any point in the game if you have enough money, you should replace a green item with this one.\n\nIf you had a poor round, go for [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and green HP items.\n\n[Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) is solid too if you have extra money \u2014 5% more attack speed and more ammo, which is very useful because you start to burn ammo VERY fast.",
