            "notes": "[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) for even more damage.\n\nIf you then still have enough money, which often you do: I HIGHLY recommend replacing one of the green items with [Blastproof Boots](item_530190fc-db36-481e-9bd7-4a0a05c5e53d). This opens up highgrounds, escapes, and more options overall.\n\nIf you are balling, you can just get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nOther options instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27):\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is better vs. easy-to-beam comps. Makes bubble a bit better too. [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) can be switched in for [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf).",
