        {
            "id": "00599a10-57db-4348-9714-bf8d9faf4c8d",
            "build_id": "5f28948d-8f96-4393-9d89-6b27c23415ab",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:54:00.743222+00:00",
            "notes": "[Graviton Anomaly](item_ff57c3ea-a20b-47ce-85c0-82295ffbead4) is great because you get ult very fast, and it allows you to pin down heroes like Kiri or Mercy that constantly try to escape and are high value kills. Solo Grav enemies with this to get an entry pick. You can farm the enemy tank and then grav a squishy for example.\n\n[Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) is good vs. stationary comps because it still slows them even if you don't have AP to deal more damage with it.\n\nFor Items, this round it's either damage or more HP to make you more tanky and bubbles better as well.\n\nFor damage, very simple \u2014 just get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).\n\nFor defensive items, [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is very good, since you can cleanse the effect and it gives HP to your bubbles. [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) is very similar but slightly better VS DoTs (damage over time) and beams.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for poorer rounds and more sustain fights. Good with [Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b), [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is also great for this.\n\nIf enough money, [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)  can be replaced with [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).",
