            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:54:00.743222+00:00",
            "notes": "[Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) is the pick in most games; it's great vs. DoTs and debuffs. You have 10% damage reduction up quite often. [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is a good option too.\n\nIf you feel like you are ahead, get [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121), or [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), or [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688). [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is better vs. more sustained comps where you don't instantly blow up, letting you beam longer. [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) is good if you\u2019re ahead a lot and there are many targets you can\u2019t reach easily, like Juno, Mercy, Genji, or Freja.\n\nIf you feel like you burn through ammo fast, then you can replace a green item with [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) since it has 5% attack speed as well.",
