            "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:54:00.743222+00:00",
            "notes": "The remaining powers are not that important, so you can pick what you like.\n\n[Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b) helps to confirm kills on gravs and slows down stationary heroes.  \n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) gives you cheap AP and improves bubbles by 25% if it's at 5 stacks, and also gives 12.5 more HP.\n\n[Here to Spot You](item_170b78de-4cbc-4b72-9efe-85ec58ac59ef) is mobility and survivability. You can use this to engage or disengage. It also gets you to high grounds at times, and the 20% healing is solid.\n\n[Pre-Workout](item_cdfbf8ce-d7cc-4b31-9c59-8b65fcb7b158) if you want to go for the lifesteal route with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643).\n\n[Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) is still a win-more item because it's so expensive. Only buy if ahead and vs. mobile heroes that are hard to reach.\n\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if you can reach flying heroes \u2014 good with [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688). HP and attack speed are very valuable as well, though.\n\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) can replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you have enough money, since it also gives 25 HP.\n\nIf you feel like you run out of ammo fast, you can get [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) since it's still a 10% damage increase.",
